e, this property also has many other important locations and services close to it like Shimpoli road, Haridas nagar road, Kastur park road, L Bhandari marg & Shimpoli chikuwadi. Services and enterprises like Bank of baroda, Big boss beauty parlour, Nirvana, Suvarna general hospital & Kamla Yamaha etc. are also close to this property.\n\nStructural Brief:\n\nThis beautiful property called Mayfair Shyam is proposed to be a 1 Tower / 14 Floors / 13 Units.\n\n#### Details of Apartments Available\n\nType : Residential Flats   \nPrice : 1.74 Cr Onwards   \nAvailable : 2 BHK, 3 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments, 693 Sq.ft To 969 Sq.ft   \nFor Booking Call us : +919820575619\n\n#### Mayfair Shyam An introduction [...] ## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n --- \n| 2 BHK | 693 | 1.74 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 874 | 2.19 CR |\n| 3.5 BHK | 969 | 2.43 CR |\n\nNote: Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. \\Rates are indicative.\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK Floor Plan\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nAddress: Shimpoli road, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nClose To: Shimpoli road, Haridas nagar road, Kastur park road, L Bhandari marg & Shimpoli chikuwadi\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about MAYFAIR SHYAM\n\n## Share This Project\n\n## Similar Properties in Borivali West\n\nShree Madhuvan Dham\n\nby Sunder Corporation\n\n### Shree Madhuvan Dham\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSumit Garden Grove\n\nby Sumit Woods Pvt. Ltd [...] #### Areas and Facilities in proximity\n\nBeing located at Borivali West, this project gives your business a lot of advantage. Major roads and landmarks like Shimpoli road, Haridas nagar road, Kastur park road, L Bhandari marg & Shimpoli chikuwadi are extremely close to this project. Other critical facilities and important entities in close proximity include Bank of baroda, Big boss beauty parlour, Nirvana, Suvarna general hospital & Kamla Yamaha etc.\n\n#### Structure Details\n\n1 Tower / 14 Floors / 13 Units\n\n#### Highlights of Mayfair Shyam\n\nType : Residential Flats   \nPrice : 1.74 Cr Onwards   \nAvailable : 2 BHK, 3 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments, 693 Sq.ft To 969 Sq.ft\n\n#### Registration Office, Village and CTS details of Mayfair Shyam\n\n## Price List","score":0.84918517,"raw_content":null,"id":"9c2236-04"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mayfair-shyam/28139/project","title":"Mayfair Shyam, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.60 Cr Onwards | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","content":"View the latest price list for Mayfair Shyam.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\ | Action |\n --- \n| 2 BHK Apartment  617 Sq. Ft. | ₹ 1.60 Cr | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  874 Sq. Ft. | ₹ 2.27 Cr | Check Availability |\n\n\\Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nMayfair Shyam's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Mayfair Shyam | Borivali West |\n --- \n| Jun 2026 | 31900 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 31950 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 0 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30700 | 30350 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units [...] Limited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Mayfair Shyam\n\n## How does Mayfair Shyam compare with similar projects?\n\nMayfair Shyam project in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n### Mayfair Shyam\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nChandak Nishchay project in Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n### Chandak Nishchay